- Managed in GitHub Projects (Projects v2) with Issues and a Kanban board.
- Free GitHub plan. The Insights tab **does** show time on the X-axis, so the built-in historical burn-up chart is available (contrary to docs suggesting Team/Enterprise only).
- I am a collaborator, not the repo owner/admin.

